<HINT>
<LIST1><ITEM><PTXT ID = "H403030063A834A59501"> The restricted vehicle speeds are reference values. The restricted vehicle speeds differ slightly between 2WD models and 4WD models.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1></HINT></MECA>
